error[E0277]: `Value` cannot describe itself as a schema
 --> tests/ui/schema/map_of_serde_json_value.rs:8:19
  |
8 |     describable::<HashMap<String, serde_json::Value>>();
  |                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ not describable
  |
  = help: the trait `SchemaTrait` is not implemented for `Value`
  = note: derive it with `#[derive(kynos::Schema)]`
  = note: some types are refused on purpose — `serde_json::Value`, `usize`, `SystemTime` and friends. Wrap one in `kynos::schema::unchecked::Unchecked` to say the payload really is unconstrained
  = help: the following other types implement trait `SchemaTrait`:
            ()
            (A, B)
            (A, B, C)
            (A, B, C, D)
            (A, B, C, D, E)
            (A, B, C, D, E, F)
            (A, B, C, D, E, F, G)
            (A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H)
          and $N others
  = note: required for `HashMap<std::string::String, Value>` to implement `SchemaTrait`
